---- max_benefit  =E=  Objective function to maximize total benefits ($)

max_benefit..  - 1.6*hydro(1) - 1.7*hydro(2) - 1.8*hydro(3) - 1.9*hydro(4) - 2*hydro(5) - 2*hydro(6) - irr(1) - 1.2*irr(2) - 1.9*irr(3) - 2*irr(4) - 2.2*irr(5) - 2.2*irr(6) + benefit =E= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- mass_balance  =E=  Reservoir storage mass balance equation (units)

mass_balance(1)..  storage(1) + hydro(1) + spill(1) =E= 7 ; (LHS = 0, INFES = 7 ****)
     
mass_balance(2)..  - storage(1) + storage(2) + hydro(2) + spill(2) =E= 2 ; (LHS = 0, INFES = 2 ****)
     
